#. type: Title #
#: docs/modules/companion.md:1 docs/modules/companion.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop Companion"
msgstr "桌面伴侣"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **桌面伴侣** / **Companion**：产品功能。**伴侣浮层**（companion overlay）：Portal 透明 VRM 窗（`embedded-overlay`）。**Outpost**（前哨）：overlay 内 `remote_tools.attach` 角色。Target shell: **Tauri**（见 [`.agent/rules/tauri-shell.md`](../../.agent/rules/tauri-shell.md)）。Not managed via `config.yaml`；**禁止**再打独立 Node sidecar。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:10
msgid ""
"The content pack (React + VRM) is embedded by the **desktop Tauri shell** "
"(`src/portal/app/tauri`). Packaged overlay loads from `frontendDist` `ui/"
"companion/` via `WebviewUrl::App` (same custom protocol as the main window — "
"**not** `file://` resources). The overlay connects with Habitat RPC, calls "
"`remote_tools.attach`, and exposes local tools (`bubble`, `play_slot`) to "
"the Agent. Product modules such as Chat use Habitat RPC only (no attach)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/modules/companion.md:11 docs/product/architecture.md:1
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:661
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/modules/companion.md:13
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
#| "│   ├── companion settings — settings window\n"
#| "│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
#| "│   └── console — Habitat WebView (Habitat REST)\n"
#| "└── Renderer — preload portalShell; companion API via localhost sidecar\n"
#| "         ↕ SAP WS\n"
#| "    anima service Habitat\n"
msgid ""
"FreeAnima Portal (src/portal/app/tauri)\n"
"├── Tauri (Rust) — tray / multi-window + prefs / IPC\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — work-area fullscreen transparent; VRM stage + remote_tools.attach\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings in main window (Habitat RPC + asset HTTP)\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (Habitat RPC, no remote_tools.attach)\n"
"│   └── habitat — Habitat WebView (Habitat RPC REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — portalShell; overlay owns attach + tool runtime\n"
"         ↕ Habitat RPC (+ remote_tools.attach in overlay only)\n"
"    anima service Habitat (companion_profile SSOT + assets + FBX→VRMA)\n"
msgstr ""
"FreeAnima Desktop (src/portal/app/tauri)\n"
"├── Tauri (Rust) — tray / multi-window + companion overlay\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings window\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
"│   └── console — Habitat WebView (Habitat REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — preload portalShell; companion API via localhost sidecar\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS\n"
"    anima service Habitat\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/companion.md:25
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Trust boundary"
msgid "Habitat vs local boundary"
msgstr "信任边界"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:33
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Attribute  | Value                                                                                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Trigger    | Sleep-cycle step `deep-sleep` (after light-sleep in DAG)                                                                                              |\n"
#| "| Target     | All active semantic memory                                                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| Operations | Contradiction detection + expiry marking, split, dedup merge, pin quality review—four sequential rounds                                               |\n"
#| "| Mode       | **Incremental** (scheduled Tue–Sun): skip quiet rounds when nothing was `updated` in 24h; **Full** (scheduled Mon + manual): all rounds on full store |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer              | Location                     | Responsibility                                                                                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Habitat SSOT**   | `src/features/companion/`    | `companion_profile` entity (behavior, slots, library meta); VRM/VRMA files under `~/.anima/companion/` on Habitat host; FBX→VRMA conversion; Settings read/write via Habitat RPC |\n"
"| **Settings UI**    | Desktop Settings → Companion | Habitat RPC（`getTypedHabitatClient`：`call` / multipart `callRaw`；`companion.config.*`、model/motion CRUD、asset.get）                                                         |\n"
"| **Companion host** | overlay SPA (`spa/`)         | `remote_tools.attach`, tool execution, local runtime (bubble/play); optional thin HTTP for static assets + `companion.sync.pull` cache                                           |\n"
"| **Tauri host**     | `src/portal/app/tauri/`       | Transparent window, click-through, tray, show/hide + FS / prefs IPC                                                                                                              |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 属性  | 值                                                                                                |\n"
"| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 触发    | sleep-cycle 步骤 `deep-sleep`（DAG 中在 light-sleep 之后）                                             |\n"
"| 目标     | 全部 active 语义记忆                                                                           |\n"
"| 操作 | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记、拆分、去重合并、置顶维护——四轮顺序执行 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:35
msgid ""
"Management is in **Settings only** — Habitat has no companion admin page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:37
msgid ""
"On host start: Habitat config wins; `~/.anima/companion/config.json` on the "
"desktop is an **offline cache**. Legacy local data is migrated once to "
"Habitat (`companion.migrate.fromLocal` or HTTP upload). Multiple desktops "
"share the same model/motion library via Habitat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/modules/companion.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Settings ──Habitat RPC/HTTP──► features/companion (Habitat)\n"
"Static   ◄──sync.pull────► Habitat          ──► local cache (VRM/VRMA)\n"
"Overlay ──remote_tools.attach──► Habitat    （bubble / play_slot 本地执行）\n"
"Tauri   ◄──IPC──────────► Settings         (show/hide, connection status)\n"
"Agent    ──Habitat RPC tool.call─► Overlay\n"
msgstr ""

